                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027SOCIAL_SHARER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Social Sharer\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user\u0027s primary mode of engagement is tagging friends to share content they find relatable, funny, or interesting. Their comments act as a bridge, bringing their personal network into the influencer\u0027s orbit.\",\n",
