                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027MINIMALIST_REACTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Minimalist Reactor\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027Communicates almost exclusively through emojis or single words to express immediate emotional reactions like laughter, love, or applause. They provide quick, low-effort feedback that signals content resonance.\u0027,\n",
