                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"Consistently leaves short, enthusiastic, and positive comments expressing admiration and support. They are a reliable source of encouragement, celebrating the influencer\u0027s content, appearance, and achievements.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027quantitative_signals\u0027: [\u0027Consistently positive sentiment\u0027,\n",
