                                                                          "   \u0027Stupenda è poco!!! Wow 😍\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMPATHIC_STORYTELLER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Empathic Storyteller\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"Connects deeply with the influencer\u0027s personal narratives by sharing their own detailed anecdotes, vulnerabilities, and emotional reflections. Their comments build a sense of shared human experience and empathy.\",\n",
