                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027COMMUNITY_BUILDER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Community Builder\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027Actively fosters conversation by replying to other commenters, asking questions, and participating in discussions. They treat the comment section as a social space for interaction with peers.\u0027,\n",
