                                                                          "   \u0027Tua sorella fa i bofffffolotti!\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CURIOUS_INQUIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Curious Inquirer\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027Uses the comment section to seek information, asking direct questions about products, locations, personal details, or context mentioned in the post. Their engagement is driven by a practical need for knowledge.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027quantitative_signals\u0027: [\u0027High question rate (\u003e50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments seek specific, practical information\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Often asks \u0027where can I buy...?\u0027 or \u0027what is...?\u0027\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engagement is often transactional and information-driven\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027example_comments\u0027: [\u0027Ti posso chiedere che rossetto indossi...grazie\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"dove l\u0027hai comprata? la vorrei anche io 😊\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027non ho capito,chi mi spiega?\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THOUGHTFUL_CONTRIBUTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Thoughtful Contributor\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"Provides detailed, well-reasoned comments that offer analysis, expert advice, or a deep perspective on the post\u0027s topic. They elevate the conversation with substantive and often lengthy contributions.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027quantitative_signals\u0027: [\u0027Very high average word count (\u003e30)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (focus on text)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are analytical, advisory, or philosophical\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Often engages with more serious or complex topics\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027example_comments\u0027: [\"Fare sport significa tutto e niente. C\u0027è dentro il rugby e il nuoto.\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Purtroppo il nascondersi dietro a uno schermo ha dato una scusa alle persone a dare il peggio di sé e a sfogare le proprie frustrazioni.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comunque in questi giorni non faccio che pensare che non ti saresti mai e poi mai dovuta iscrivere in palestra. Questa situazione è la vendetta del Dio Divano.\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_OBSERVER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Casual Observer\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027Represents the long tail of engagement, commenting infrequently with short, often generic, remarks. Their interaction is sporadic and low-effort, often occurring long after the post is published.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027quantitative_signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1-2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High average hours to comment (late engagement)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Short, general comments (e.g. \u0027Mitica\u0027)\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low reply ratio\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027example_comments\u0027: [\u0027Mitica\u0027, \u0027Sta matta!\u0027, \u0027La vita scivola via\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027SKEPTIC_AND_CRITIC\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Skeptic \u0026 Critic\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027Engages by offering critical feedback, factual corrections, or a contrarian viewpoint. Their comments challenge the influencer or other commenters, fostering debate or expressing dissent.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027quantitative_signals\u0027: [\u0027Comments express negative or critical opinions\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Often provides corrections (grammar, facts)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027May have a confrontational or judgmental tone\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027example_comments\u0027: [\"Ma se sei la regina della digital distorsion! Un\u0027altro brand da boicottare. Che delusione @dove\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Sesto Campano è in Molise...\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027\"beacause\"\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EVENT_FOLLOWER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027label\u0027: \u0027The Event Follower\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027Engages specifically with time-sensitive content like tour announcements, ticket sales, or live events. Their comments express excitement, frustration with availability, or requests for their city to be included.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027quantitative_signals\u0027: [\u0027Engages with event/ticket-related posts\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are time-sensitive and action-oriented\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Often expresses strong emotion (hope, disappointment)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Frequently an early commenter on announcement posts\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027example_comments\u0027: [\u0027È tutto il giorno che proviamo ma nulla.. sold out in pochissimo, speriamo nelle nuove date :(\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Palermo pleaseeee😢❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Cami, aggiungi Foggia o Bari🤞🏻🤞🏻🤞🏻\u0027]}]"
                                                                      ]
                                                   },
