                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: low (e.g., 4)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@luca_pec_ lei è stupenda\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EVENT_SEEKER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user is highly engaged with time-sensitive content like event announcements, expressing personal experiences and hopes related to participation.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
