                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CONSISTENT_COMMENTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user is highly active and quick to comment on various types of posts, offering both short compliments and more elaborate opinions.\u0027,\n",
