                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027SOCIAL_CONNECTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027A user who primarily engages by tagging friends in comments, often relating the content to shared experiences or inside jokes.\u0027,\n",
