                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CHRONICLER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This highly engaged and long-term follower consistently leaves detailed, often humorous or descriptive comments, frequently referencing pop culture or personal anecdotes related to the post\u0027s theme.\",\n",
