                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CASUAL OBSERVER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user leaves infrequent, short comments, often tagging a friend or expressing a simple, relatable sentiment without deep engagement.\u0027,\n",
