                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027HELPER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user offers practical advice or solutions, often in response to a perceived problem or query from the influencer, demonstrating a helpful and direct approach.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"High reply ratio (100%) - though it\u0027s a direct comment to the influencer, it\u0027s framed as a response/solution\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero emoji rate\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comment is a direct suggestion or solution\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with posts where the influencer might be expressing a minor issue (e.g., not posting photos)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@camihawke disinstalla e reinstalla l’app di Instagram, con me ha funzionato!\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_ENGAGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user comments sporadically but quickly, often making lighthearted, relatable observations or tagging friends in content that resonates with their personal experiences.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (2)\u0027,\n",
