                                                                          "   \u0027High early commenter rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are often relatable or involve tagging a friend\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027tutto in cucina Cami 😂 trucco e cibo\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@gio.990 io e cami stessa camicia, siamo amici per la pelle ❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027RELATABLE_RESPONDER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user makes a single, relatable comment, often with a touch of self-deprecating humor, connecting their own experiences to the influencer\u0027s post.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
