                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\"@sni.nna se l\u0027avessi fatto io, il dopo sarebbe stata la mia tomba 😂😂\"]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona expresses strong, often unique, personal admiration for the influencer, focusing on their appearance or specific traits.\u0027,\n",
