                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027I tuoi occhi sono come le scale di harry potter\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CHEERLEADER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona consistently provides short, enthusiastic, and emoji-rich positive feedback across many posts, showing general appreciation.\u0027,\n",
