                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are generally positive and appreciative.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Long activity span.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Bellissimo 😍\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027😂😂😂😂😂 mi fai scompisciare 😂😂😂😂😂\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Bellissimi 😍 come sempre ❤️ buon viaggio ❣️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_ENGAGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages sporadically, often with a single, brief comment that might be a direct response to the post\u0027s content or a simple acknowledgement.\",\n",
