                                                                          "   \u0027Very low average word count\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Perdona @guglielmoscilla\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027RELATABLE_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona connects with the influencer\u0027s content on a personal level, often relating it to their own life or expressing strong emotional resonance, frequently using emojis.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate total comments across multiple unique posts\u0027,\n",
