                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate average word count\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments often include personal anecdotes or expressions of strong emotion (e.g., \u0027Sto morendo\u0027).\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with diverse content types (images, reels).\u0027],\n",
