                                                                          "   \u0027@camihawke tantissimi auguroni bellissima ❤️❤️❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Siete bellissimi 😍 😍 @camihawke\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027INTERACTIVE_SUPPORTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona actively engages with the influencer by asking questions, offering strong praise, and sometimes tagging the influencer directly, showing a desire for interaction.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate total comments across multiple unique posts\u0027,\n",
