                                                                          "   \u0027Fenomenale @camihawke\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027No ma qua roba vera di qualità - parliamone 😆 @camihawke\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMOJI_REACTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user rarely comments but, when they do, they express strong, often humorous, emotional reactions primarily through emojis and very short phrases, engaging with both personal and sponsored content.\u0027,\n",
