                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ENGAGED_CONVERSATIONALIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user consistently engages with a variety of content, asking questions, offering advice, and sharing personal anecdotes, indicating a desire for interaction and connection with the influencer and community.\u0027,\n",
