                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_ENGAGED_PEER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user comments quickly and frequently, often tagging friends or making relatable, humorous observations that align with the influencer\u0027s tone.\",\n",
