                                                                          "   \"@marianna_celeste80 Vicino a casa mia ce n\u0027era un allevamento\"]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_ENGAGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user actively participates in the comment section, often replying to others or the influencer with short, enthusiastic, and humorous remarks, engaging with light-hearted and creative content.\u0027,\n",
