                                                                          "   \u0027@lucrezianiscosarlo ci sono geni e geni alla fine\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_ASTRO_ANALYST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user provides detailed, often all-caps comments, quickly engaging with content that touches on personal traits, self-reflection, or relatable life observations, possibly linking it to broader themes like astrology.\u0027,\n",
