                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: 50%+\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on personal, health, or lifestyle-related posts\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\"@oltreladieta io uso anche l\u0027olio 31, mi allevia il dolore per un po\u0027. Ma neanche i farmaci alle volte riescono. Io risento tantissimo dello stress e delle poche ore di sonno quindi concentro tutto su questo, ma alle volte è impossibile pianificare tutto 🤦 prima del ciclo la mia emicrania è devastante.\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Dove hai com\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE GRAMMAR POLICE\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona focuses on correcting linguistic errors in the post\u0027s caption, indicating a keen eye for detail and a desire for accuracy.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments directly address spelling/grammar mistakes\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027\"beacause\"\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENGAGED WIT\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona responds to humorous or entertaining content with short, witty remarks, often referencing specific elements of the post and sometimes engaging in light banter.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 6\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 50%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 50%+\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on comedic or light-hearted content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Vabhè ma con Sufjan Stevens sotto è tenero anche un topo scusa!\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@lory_daysleeper_ 🤣🤣🤣\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMOJI_APPLAUDER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user consistently expresses strong positive sentiment through a high volume of emojis, often commenting immediately after a post goes live.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: 0.0h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 75%+\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027🔥❤️🙌👏\u0027, \u0027@camihawke ❤️❤️❤️\\U0001faf6🏻🙌🏻\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027LAUGHING_OBSERVER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user rarely comments, but when they do, it\u0027s a pure, emoji-driven reaction of amusement, often to humorous or nostalgic content, and not necessarily in real-time.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e2000h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😂😂😂😂😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027AFFIRMING_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user expresses direct affection or strong positive affirmation towards the influencer, often with short, heartfelt phrases.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 3-4\u0027, \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027, \u0027Question rate: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Io ti amo hahahaha\u0027, \u0027@enzacast la amo\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ENGAGED_RESPONDER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user directly engages with other commenters or the influencer by replying, often with a playful or familiar tone.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Reply ratio: 100%\u0027, \u0027Avg word count: 4\u0027, \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@thelizadiaries sempre poco permalosa\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMOJI_ENTHUSIAST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user expresses their reactions solely through emojis, often in multiples, indicating a quick and visual engagement with content.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 0\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with humorous or visually appealing content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😅😅😅\u0027, \u0027👏👏😅😅😅\u0027, \u0027😍😍\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CONTENT_SHARER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user primarily engages by tagging others, indicating they use the platform to share content with their network.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 2 (often just tags)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments consist solely of @mentions\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@fabrizio_raimondi_cominesi @katia_martone\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027QUICK_APPRECIATOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user provides short, direct compliments or observations, often commenting quickly after a post goes live.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 50% or higher\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: low (1-3 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0% (prefers text)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Fisicazzo\u0027, \u0027Il buon vecchio stevino\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THOUGHTFUL_COMMENTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user crafts longer, more reflective comments, often relating the post\u0027s content to broader ideas or personal experiences.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: high (e.g., 30+ words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are narrative or opinion-based\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Comunque in questi giorni non faccio che pensare che non ti saresti mai e poi mai dovuta iscrivere in palestra. Questa situazione è la vendetta del Dio Divano. Noi pigri lo sappiamo.\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027LOYAL_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user consistently offers positive, supportive comments, often spanning a long activity period and expressing admiration for the influencer.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Activity span: very long (e.g., 600+ days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are consistently positive/complimentary\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with a variety of content types\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027La coppia più bella del mondo. Auguri ad entrambi! ❤️❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Cami sei splendida!!!!\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027😂Unica\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ENGAGED_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona is highly engaged, comments quickly and enthusiastically, often using humor and emojis, and shows genuine interest in the influencer\u0027s personal life and future content.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c1h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): \u003e60%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: \u003e90%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003e10\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: \u003e30%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027E la parte migliore di tutto ciò è che è solo il primo giorno!!!!! la situa non può che migliorare 😏😏😏 ho grandi aspettative per l’igtv di questa vacanza!!!✌🏻\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Ci stava anche il volo dell’angelo dalla cima della madonnina..sobrio sobrio 🤟🏻\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027E un paio di quanto manca no???😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_INTERACTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages infrequently, often with short, emoji-only comments, and may be reacting to a specific detail or a tagged friend rather than the influencer\u0027s broader content.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e24h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003c5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: \u003e90%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@suelaq_ 😂😂😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CRITICAL_OBSERVER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona engages with specific details in the content, often providing factual corrections or specific, sometimes dry, observations, and tends to comment less frequently and without emojis.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: \u003c5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003e5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Activity span: \u003e1000 days\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Sesto Campano è in Molise...\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Metti il piede li, in quella rientranza a forma di vertebra di moffetta.\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ASPIRING_SHOPPER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona is interested in product details and sourcing, often asking direct questions about where to purchase items featured in the posts.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003c10\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Splendida!!!!! Dove lo hai preso?\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027APPRECIATIVE_VIEWER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona offers quick, positive affirmations, often commenting early and concisely to express admiration for the influencer or the content.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003c5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: \u003c50%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Bellissima!!!\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_SUPERFAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona is highly engaged, comments quickly with strong positive emotions and frequent emojis, celebrating the influencer\u0027s personal milestones and life updates.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High comment frequency (relative to total posts)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low average hours to comment (often \u003c1h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (\u003e80%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low word count (short, emotional bursts)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal, emotional, or celebratory content.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027💙\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Ma woooooow! Bellissima notiziaaa 😍\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Che bello super felice per voiiiii! 💕☺️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_CONVERSATIONALIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages with the influencer\u0027s personality and calls for interaction, offering thoughtful or witty comments rather than just emotional reactions.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Lower comment frequency (may comment on specific prompts)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Higher average word count (more substantial comments)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (focus on text-based expression)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments directly address the influencer or content\u0027s premise.\"],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@camihawke o sei pronta per entrare in politica (umilmente)\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_CURIOUS_OBSERVER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages less frequently but with specific, often late, questions or observations, showing a deeper, analytical interest in the content\u0027s implications.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low comment frequency (single comments observed)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very high average hours to comment (comments much later)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High question rate (comments are often questions)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with narrative or storytelling content, seeking clarification or deeper meaning.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Praticamente questa la dobbiamo prendere come una confessione ? 😅\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_SOCIAL_CONNECTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona primarily uses comments to tag friends, sharing content they find relevant or amusing with their personal network.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low word count (often just a tag)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High reply ratio (if tagging in response to another comment, though not seen here)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are almost exclusively @-mentions of other users.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with diverse content, acting as a content curator for friends.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@angelicasantagata tullo\u0027, \u0027@francescadelbecchi\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE QUICK REACTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user leaves short, immediate, and often emotional reactions to content, particularly comedic or engaging videos.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c1h (100% early commenter)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: low (1-3 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: low (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with comedic reels\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Piango dal ridere\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE SUPPORTIVE CHEERLEADER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user offers quick, positive, and emoji-rich affirmations, especially on personal or celebratory posts.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c1h (100% early commenter)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: low (1-3 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: high (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal/celebratory content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Tanti auguri ❤️❤️\u0027, \u0027Adoro🥰😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE LOYAL CONVERSATIONALIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This long-term follower engages consistently across various content types, leaving thoughtful, descriptive comments and occasionally interacting with others.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: high (37)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Activity span: very long (2740 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: moderate (14.0h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: low but present (5%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: moderate (10 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: moderate (41%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with diverse content (personal, lifestyle, opinion)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Si mi piaceva anche un periodo, poi però non mi ha più convinto. E va be, se ne farà una ragione😂\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Per me c\u0027è solo della gnoccagine😍\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Aiuto sei coraggiosissima. Io non avrei mai affrontato quella montagna\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENGAGED FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user actively participates in discussions related to the influencer\u0027s content, often referencing specific details or ongoing themes.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: low (3)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Activity span: long (822 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c1h (67% early commenter)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: moderate (13 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: high (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments show deep understanding of content context (e.g., \u0027Team Conrad\u0027, \u0027Camihawke be like\u0027)\"],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Io impazzirei, già con il diamond painting sto al limite😂\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Conrad tossichello lei pure non è da meno, eterna indecisa, Jeremiah il 🔝 prossima stagione per gli indecisi ménage ✨✨😂\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027E il Camihawke be like: non spacchetto più nulla con voi😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE DEBATER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages thoughtfully with the content\u0027s premise, often offering their own perspective or a humorous counter-point, and asks questions to foster discussion.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High question rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Higher average word count (9 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with opinion-based or interactive content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Pordenone in Friuli?\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Pordenone sta in Campania secondo me\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE EMOTIONAL RESPONDER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona reacts quickly and expressively to posts, primarily using emojis and often tagging friends to share their immediate emotional response.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low average word count (2-4 words)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😍😍😍😍😭\u0027, \u0027Da farci una cartolina 🤩😘\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CONNECTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona uses comments primarily to tag other users, often without additional text, indicating they are sharing or drawing attention to the post for their network.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low average word count (1-5 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High reply ratio (100% for replies, or direct mentions)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments consist mainly of @mentions\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@chiarasgambati\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@vladmanea_ sei ovunque tu\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@vladmanea_ ma tu mi spunti ovunque 😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMOJI_EXPRESSER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This archetype communicates primarily through emojis, offering quick, positive, and often generic reactions to posts, typically commenting early.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 1-2\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027👏🏻\u0027, \u0027🙌🏻 💖😘\u0027, \u0027Il pistacchio 😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CELEBRATORY_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This archetype engages with posts marking personal milestones or significant life events, offering direct, positive, and often short congratulatory messages.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 4-6\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Content focus: Personal announcements (birthdays, achievements, life changes)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Tantissimi auguri, Cami! ❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Massa Lombarda. Ma è vicino Ravenna 😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMPATHIC_ADVOCATE\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona is deeply invested in the influencer\u0027s personal and professional journey, offering thoughtful, empathetic, and highly supportive comments on significant life events and career milestones.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very fast comment time (Avg hrs to comment: 0.3h, Early commenter: 100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High average word count (22 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal and career announcement posts\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Una relazione a distanza non è mai facile. È a volte frustrante, triste e molto difficile ma quando si supera questa fase e si uniscono le forze, diventa la dimostrazione di quanto è forte un rapporto. Auguri a tutti e due per questo piccolo, grande traguardo. #esserepoveriassiemeèpiùbiurifu @camihaw\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Inizierò a guardare più spesso la rai 😍\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Auguri con una torta a base di gnocchi al pesto! 💚\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ADMIRING_FAN\u0027,\n",
