                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low question rate (0%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Una delle cose più divertenti che abbia mai visto nei secoli dei secoli\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE INTELLECTUAL FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages with thoughtful, long-form comments, often posing questions or suggesting topics for future content, showing deep appreciation for the influencer\u0027s intellectual and sarcastic style.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1-2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low unique posts (1-2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate average hours to comment (3h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low early commenter rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High average word count (50+ words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High question rate (50% or more)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Camihawke salve, mi chiamo Enrico, ti seguo da poco tempo ma già provo molta stima nei tuoi confronti e riascolto molto volentieri i video dove commenti gli stereotipi di oggi giorno.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Volevo chiederti se riusciresti creare un video, con i tuoi commenti intelligenti e sarcastici, sull\u0027importanza ke danno i giovani ai \u0027selfie\u0027\"]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE EMOTIONAL ENGAGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user expresses strong emotional reactions, often using many emojis and short, impactful phrases, focusing on the influencer\u0027s personality, humor, or appearance.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate total comments (5+)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate unique posts (5+)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Long activity span (100+ days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (80% or more)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low average word count (5-10 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low question rate (0%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\"Mi fai Morire quando hai l\u0027espressione Critica 🤣😘❤\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Il Vero Diavolo si chiama Tom Ellis 😅 Comunque sei 🥺😘❤\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027😅😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣😘\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE LOYAL ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona consistently leaves short, affectionate, and highly positive comments, often with emojis, and is quick to engage with new posts, showing long-term dedication.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low unique posts (2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very long activity span (600+ days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very low average hours to comment (0.2h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very high early commenter rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very low average word count (2 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very high emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low question rate (0%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Stupenda😍\u0027, \u0027Un abbraccio Cami❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE RELATABLE CHRONICLER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user connects the influencer\u0027s content to their own life experiences, sharing anecdotes or agreeing with sentiments, often on posts about travel, daily life, or personal reflections.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High total comments (10+)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High unique posts (10+)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very long activity span (2000+ days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate average hours to comment (12h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate early commenter rate (10%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate reply ratio (10%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate average word count (10-15 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate emoji rate (60%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate question rate (10%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Io Phoebe che stava con quel gran bel gnoccolone di Cole\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@_giorgiagio_ concordo! Io feci lo stesso 2 sett in Indonesia e 3 tra Giappone e Filippine, viaggi con vestiti x 1 settimana e li lavi ogni tot\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Ricordi di una terra meravigliosa tra litri di tè alla menta super dolce, pastilla cous cous e altre meravigliose co\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENTHUSIAST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user is highly engaged, quick to comment, and directly addresses the influencer with enthusiastic, short, and personal greetings.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1 (per post)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c0.5h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003c5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Hahahhahaha ciao camillaaaaa @camihawke\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMOJI REACTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user expresses strong emotional reactions to content primarily through emojis, often tagging friends to share the sentiment.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1 (per post)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003c2\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 100% (often tagging another user)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@francescalopilato 🤤🤤\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CONVERSATIONALIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This long-term, highly active follower engages with a wide range of posts, offering thoughtful, often humorous, and sometimes questioning comments that invite further discussion.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: \u003e20\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Unique posts: \u003e20\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Activity span: \u003e2000 days\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003e10\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: ~30%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: ~10%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Volevi dire me cojoni? (Non voglio fare polemica o altro sono sinceramente confusa dall’uso di “sti cazzi” che viene fatto fuori da Roma 😅)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Amici dei canditi e dell’uvetta per favore fondiamo un club\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Io crepata su QUO-KKA\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE APPRECIATOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user offers simple, positive, and appreciative comments, often focusing on the aesthetic or emotional value of the post.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1 (per post)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003c5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0-100% (can be mixed)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😂 ti adoro\u0027, \u0027Che bellissimo pensiero.\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CRITIC\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona engages infrequently but over a long period, commenting early with short, direct, and sometimes opinionated or sarcastic remarks, often tagging others or reacting to the influencer\u0027s persona.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Long activity span (1603 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High early commenter rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low avg word count (5)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with both aesthetic and comedic/narrative content.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@costanzaballerio morta\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Ah spe, anche permalosi e rancorosi come pochi\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE RELATABLE REACTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona makes a single, early comment, using emojis to express agreement or amusement, directly relating to the content\u0027s theme.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short activity span (0 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High early commenter rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very low avg word count (3)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments directly confirm relatability to content.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Breve storia reale. 😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE TAGGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona\u0027s primary interaction is to tag another user in the comments, indicating they are sharing the content with a friend rather than expressing a personal opinion.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short activity span (0 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very high early commenter rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Minimal avg word count (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comment consists solely of a user tag.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@casaliylenia\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona offers simple, positive compliments, often using emojis, focusing on the influencer\u0027s appearance.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short activity span (0 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low early commenter rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low avg word count (3)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are direct compliments on appearance.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Sei bellissima ❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE SUPERFAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona consistently expresses strong admiration and support for the influencer, using effusive language, emojis, and often specific praise for their content and personality.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate total comments (3)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate activity span (250 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low early commenter rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High avg word count (13)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments include direct praise, emotional language, and hashtags.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Grande @camihawke 💗\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Il rosso è uno schianto!!! Love love love 😘😘 GRANDE CAMI\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Intelligenza simpatia e bellezza tutto in una sola donna.. te sei semplicemente lo stereotipo di donna che adoro.. brava!!! Stories pazzesche e divertentissime.. montate in maniera geniale #camihawkepersempre\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027NOSTALGIC_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This archetype expresses a preference for the influencer\u0027s past content or style, often with a short, direct, and slightly melancholic tone.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low comment frequency (often single comment)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Average word count around 5 words\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero emoji or question rate\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on content that might be perceived as a departure from previous styles.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Mi manca il vecchio willwoosh\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ENGAGED_CONVERSATIONALIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This archetype actively participates in the influencer\u0027s narrative, offering personal opinions, agreeing with the content, and adding a touch of humor or self-reference.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate word count (around 20+ words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero emoji or question rate (in this sample)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on opinion-based or personal narrative content.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Per me li hai azzeccati tutti, concordo su tutta la linea! Ma sono della Vergine quindi non saremmo comunque BFF... Mi disp...\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027DEVOTED_ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This archetype expresses strong, direct affection and support for the influencer, often with very short, impactful statements.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low word count (around 2 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero emoji or question rate (in this sample)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on posts where the influencer expresses a strong opinion or personal struggle.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Ti amo!\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027SARCASM_KING\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This archetype uses humor and sarcasm, often in the form of rhetorical questions, to engage with the content, sometimes with a slightly provocative edge.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low word count (around 3 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%) and question rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on lighthearted or anecdotal posts.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027E sti cazzi? 🤪🙃\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027LONG_TERM_SUPPORTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This archetype shows consistent, albeit infrequent, engagement over a long period, expressing appreciation and affection for the influencer\u0027s content, often with emojis.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low comment frequency but across a long activity span (e.g., 261 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate word count (around 6 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate emoji rate (50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on diverse content, from dance reels to personal stories about objects.\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Ciao Pasqualino!!! 🥰\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027E niente! Più lo guardo e poi lo guarderei BRIVIDJJU\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CREATIVE_CONTRIBUTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user actively participates in creative prompts, offering thoughtful suggestions and engaging with the content\u0027s artistic or intellectual challenge.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with posts asking for creative input (e.g., titles)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\"Aequilibrium amoris (l\u0027equilibrio dell\u0027amore) ❤️\"]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027DRY_HUMORIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user expresses agreement or reaction to humorous content with short, often sarcastic or exasperated comments, typically without emojis and with delayed engagement.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e100h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 2\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with humorous rants or relatable frustrations\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Che palle\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027FACT_CHECKER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user provides factual, location-specific, or corrective information, engaging directly with the topic\u0027s details rather than emotional or creative aspects.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e24h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 3\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments directly relate to specific details or locations mentioned in the post\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Vivo in Franciacorta….\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027LOYAL_APPRECIATOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user consistently expresses strong positive sentiment and admiration for the influencer\u0027s appearance or achievements, often using emojis and engaging over a long period.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: \u003e10\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Activity span: \u003e2000 days\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: \u003e80%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003e5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments frequently include compliments and expressions of beauty/admiration\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Ma stai benissimo con la frangetta!!!!!!!!!!! 😍🥰🥰🥰\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Wow \\U0001fa77\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Bellissima wow ❤️\\u200d🔥\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027NICHE_ENGAGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user engages with specific, often less mainstream, content, showing a connection to the influencer\u0027s personal interests or inside jokes.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Activity span: \u003e80 days\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003e5\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments include specific hashtags or references to niche topics/influencer\u0027s personal life\"],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Grazi mili è il mio mantra👌\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Con la mente a quelli dell\u0027instagra e feisbu...#teamsnapcia\"]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENTHUSIAST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona expresses strong, immediate positive sentiment, often using emojis and direct compliments, indicating deep admiration for the influencer\u0027s content or personality.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 9\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Strong positive language\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Ci vuole coraggio a scrivere determinate cose!!!\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Sei fenomenale 😘\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE AFFECTIONATE LURKER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona engages with content much later, often with minimal text and high emoji usage, suggesting a passive but heartfelt appreciation for nostalgic or emotionally resonant posts.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e1000h (very late)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with emotional/nostalgic content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CONTRIBUTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona responds directly to prompts or questions in the content, offering concise, relevant contributions, even if their engagement is delayed.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e1000h (very late)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 3\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Directly answers content prompts\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027VENEZIA in Friuli-VENEZIA-Giulia\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CHEERLEADER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona offers brief, highly positive, and encouraging comments, often using emojis, to show support for the influencer or their shared experiences.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 0% (but still within a reasonable timeframe for a single comment)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 3\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Positive, supportive language\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Augurissimi!\u0027, \u0027Siete splendidi!❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE RELATABLE FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona connects with the influencer\u0027s content on a personal level, sharing their own experiences or preferences in response to a relatable topic or question.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: 2.5h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 10\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Personal anecdote/connection in comment\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027vabbè raga io mi chiamo Alyssa solo per questo programma🥳\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_SHOPPER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user is interested in the influencer\u0027s style and product recommendations, often asking for specific details about items seen in posts.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High question rate (when they comment)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Specific product/fashion inquiries\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engagement with lifestyle/fashion content\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate word count\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Often includes emojis\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Dove hai comprato il vestito arancione di due giorni faa (quello con le spalle fuori)🔥\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_CONNECTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user uses the comment section as a social space to tag friends and initiate real-world plans or share content with their network.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High reply ratio (often tagging others)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short, action-oriented comments\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engagement with travel/experience-based content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@virg_uenda dobbiamo organizzarci via! 😎\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_ADVOCATE\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user is a highly engaged and supportive follower who expresses strong agreement, admiration, and defends the influencer against perceived negativity.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Longer comments with detailed opinions\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High word count\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Expresses strong positive sentiment and agreement\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with opinion-based or humorous content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@camihawke a parte che ti trovo bellissima (e te lo dice una ragazza...la foto del profilo è ingannevole) sei simpaticissima, ironica, mi piace come parli...concordo su tutto quello che hai detto, bravissima 👏🏻...\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027La ricotta salata o quella infornata qui in Sicilia si grattano rigorosamente del lato a scaglie\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_CASUAL_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user expresses simple appreciation or amusement with short, often emoji-only comments, indicating light engagement.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low word count (often 0)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Late commenter\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engagement with humorous or visually appealing content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😍\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_HUMORIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user engages with the influencer\u0027s comedic content, often adding their own humorous take or relating to the joke with a lighthearted comment.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Engagement with comedic/storytelling reels\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (especially laughing emojis)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate word count, often anecdotal or observational\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Late commenter\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Si vede che la gente che lo occupa porta profumi nn piacevoli per la padrona di casa. 😂😂😂😂😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE FAMILIAR FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user engages with personal and reflective content, often sharing observations or expressing a sense of familiarity and long-term connection with the influencer.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate word count (14)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Long activity span (1348 days) with low comment volume\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments on personal/family-oriented content and influencer\u0027s personal projects\"],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Pssss io sono già iscritta 🤩\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Tu uguale a mamma, tuo fratello lato apposto uguale a tuo babbo e il fratello del mezzo un mix perfetto di entrambi!! 🧡\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENGAGED ENTHUSIAST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user is highly reactive and enthusiastic, commenting quickly with short, emoji-rich messages, often asking questions or expressing strong positive reactions to trending or announcement content.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very early commenter (100% within 1 hour)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short average word count (7)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Asks questions (33% question rate)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with trending content and event announcements\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Ma una tappa in Friuli? 🥲\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Ma di cosa stiamo parlandoooo 🔥😮\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE TAGGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user primarily engages by tagging friends, indicating a desire to share content and involve their network, often with minimal personal commentary.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027100% reply ratio (implies tagging in response or to share)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very short word count (3)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero emoji rate\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments consist solely of tags\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@agatabellini io Claudio\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE SUPPORTIVE ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user offers positive reinforcement and compliments, often focusing on the influencer\u0027s personality, appearance, or content quality, sometimes with a touch of humor.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate emoji rate (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate word count (8)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on a variety of content, including personal reflections and humorous posts\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Expresses appreciation and compliments\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027A me sembri sempre molto bella e mai scontata, anche negli errori, se così li vuoi chiamare....\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027😂😂😂😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE LOYAL CHEERLEADER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user expresses strong, often hyperbolic, admiration for the influencer, frequently tagging others to share their enthusiasm and praise.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Moderate emoji rate (33%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short word count (5)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Tags other users in comments\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are highly complimentary and enthusiastic\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Fai swish meglio della ferragni❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@gabrielebll la amo alla follia ahahahahah\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@gabrielebll che fica\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona consistently expresses strong positive sentiment, often praising the influencer\u0027s appearance and offering personal well wishes, typically with short, emoji-rich comments.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High emoji rate (80%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low average word count (3)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High early commenter rate (80%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Long activity span (1363 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal/appearance-focused posts\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027WOW, Stupenda camiiii😍\u0027, \u0027STUPENDA 😍\u0027, \u0027Auguri Cami!❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CHEERLEADER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This highly engaged persona offers consistent, extremely brief, and emoji-driven reactions across diverse content, often acknowledging specific elements or people within the posts.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very high emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Extremely low average word count (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very high early commenter rate (83%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very long activity span (1761 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with varied content (practical advice, entertainment)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😍😍😍\u0027, \u0027JEREMIAH🙌\u0027, \u0027Leo❤️❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CURIOUS NEWBIE\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona asks direct, specific questions about the content, often seeking practical information or details, and tends to be a one-time or infrequent commenter.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High question rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Single comment/post engagement\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate word count (14)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with informational/transformational content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027che programma hai usato x cambiarti di colore???\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027comunque stai bene con tutti!!!!! ❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE REFLECTIVE INQUIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona engages with content by posing reflective questions, often relating to the emotional or experiential aspect of the post, and comments infrequently.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High question rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Single comment/post engagement\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Delayed comment time (13.1h avg)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with experiential/achievement-oriented content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Quanto si sta bene però una volta arrivati su? ❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE TAGGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona\u0027s primary interaction is to tag other users, indicating a desire to share content with friends or draw their attention to it, with minimal or no additional text.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Extremely low average word count (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero emoji rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero question rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Single comment/post engagement\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Delayed comment time (21.8h avg)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@mariaeva95\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_TAGGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user engages infrequently, often with a single, short comment, primarily to tag another user, indicating they are sharing the content rather than deeply interacting with the influencer.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Late commenter (Avg hrs to comment \u003e 10h)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@federica_marago\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027REACTIVE_COMMENTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user posts short, emotionally charged, or ironic comments, often in direct response to the specific theme or humor of a post, sometimes using strong language.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 3\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very late commenter (Avg hrs to comment \u003e 20h)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Mannaggia alla mad....\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027EMOJI_APPRECIATOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user consistently expresses positive sentiment through very short comments, relying heavily on emojis to convey enthusiasm and affection for the influencer and their content.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments on diverse content (fashion, personal thoughts)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Le gioie 😂💗\u0027, \u0027💗\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027DEDICATED_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This highly engaged user comments frequently and thoughtfully over a long period, expressing deep emotional connection, support, and detailed reactions to the influencer\u0027s personal stories and content.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Total comments: 9 (high)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Unique posts: 9 (high)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Activity span: 1427 days (very long)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 9 (descriptive)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal/emotional content (childhood photos, pet loss)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Che dolore sapere queste cose e voi siete stati di una forza enorme a dirlo dopo tanto tempo. Tonino sarà un bellissimo gattone ,amato perché non si può non amarlo ❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Lo aspettavamo da tanto tantissimo. Lo prenderò sicuramente e sono molto anzi moltissimo curiosa di leggerlo. Dajeeee👏👏👏\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027♥️Ti abbraccio fortissimo\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027AESTHETIC_ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user consistently posts short, positive comments, often using emojis, to compliment the influencer\u0027s appearance or the visual appeal of their posts.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 80%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments primarily on influencer\u0027s photos/selfies\"],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😍😍 sei così bella!!!\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027💙💙\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027😍😍😍😍 la mia Weasley preferita!!!! 💙\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_CHIMER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user is highly reactive, often tagging friends in short, emoji-rich comments that express shared amusement or recognition, typically engaging with relatable or nostalgic content.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c1h (very fast)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: Low (2-3 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: High (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Frequent tagging of other users\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@elenaguggi era questooooooo😂😂😂\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@elenaguggi un tunnel\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_REFLECTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user engages with thoughtful, emotional, or educational content, often leaving more descriptive and appreciative comments, sometimes on older posts.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: High (can be very late, suggesting deep dives)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: Moderate to High (8+ words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: Moderate (50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments express appreciation for content or mood\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Melancholia ❤️\\u200d🩹\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"MA POI SENZA UN SECONDO DI PAUSA PER RIFLETTERE, UNA PAROLA DIETRO L\u0027ALTRA, IDOLO\"]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_LAUGHER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user primarily expresses amusement or agreement through short, often repetitive, and emoji-heavy comments, frequently tagging others to share the humor.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: Varies, but can be fast\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: Very low (2 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: High (50-100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments are often exclamations of laughter or simple agreement\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@r_raso_ AHAHAHAHAHAHAHA\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@vanessa_tisba 🤣🤣🤣🤣\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@vanessa_tisba vero vero\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE_ARCHIVIST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user engages with older, significant posts, often referencing past content or events, and provides more detailed, supportive comments.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: Very high (144.3h, indicating engagement with older content)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: High (18 words)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: Moderate (50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comments often provide context or refer to previous influencer content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Galeotte furono le tue stories sulla sua pizza da 16 euro! Brava 💪🏽🎊\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@gabriiz_ vai su fb e cerca un video in cui Cami parla della pizza di Cracco (si vede che sei in ferie)\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027INTERACTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This loyal follower consistently engages early and directly with the influencer, using emojis and questions, showing a desire for two-way communication across various content types.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High early commenter rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate reply/question rate (33%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Long activity span (1262 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with both personal and sponsored content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@alessiamp 😊👏🏻 giusto?\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@alessiamp yes❤️\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@camihawke magari ha risolto e può aiutarti😊\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_SHARER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user makes quick, emoji-rich comments, often tagging friends, primarily on humorous or relatable content, indicating a tendency to share or react to entertaining posts.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very early commenter (0.1h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very low word count (2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Tags other users in comments\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with humorous/relatable Reels\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@virginiabrocchini_ k.o 😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027COMMUNITY_MEMBER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This highly active and loyal follower engages frequently with a wide range of content, offering personal anecdotes, advice, and playful banter, often with a conversational tone.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High total comments (42)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High unique posts (37)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very long activity span (1798 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High early commenter rate (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate emoji rate (64%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Higher average word count (14)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal, unfiltered, and humorous content\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027In nessuna dimensione perchè nemmeno il lunedì esiste\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Vieni anche a Lecce, ti ospito io!\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Il problema non si pone se, mentre ti lavi i denti, fai altre cose (sporcando tutto di bavina schiumosa però) come faccio io😂\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027PASSIVE_OBSERVER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user shows minimal engagement, commenting rarely and often with just a tag, suggesting they are more of a passive consumer who occasionally interacts or tags a friend.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low total comments (1-2)\u0027,\n",
