                                                                          "   \u0027Low early commenter rate (0-50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (0-50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very low word count (1-4)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Primarily tags other users or makes brief, non-committal remarks\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@martinaesposito91\u0027,\n",
