                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with content that sparks personal reflection (e.g., social commentary, personal stories)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Sei o sette anni fa, quando non si sentiva ancora parlare di cat calling, scrissi un brevissimo post su Fb dove dicevo che questi atteggiamenti erano davvero pesanti da sopportare.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Fui messa alla gogna da molti dei miei \"amici e amiche\" di allora che mi risposero che ero esagerata io, che erano comportamenti innocenti e alcune ragazze commentarono \"magari lo facessero a me\".\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_APPRECIATOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user offers brief, positive, and emoji-rich comments, often expressing immediate enjoyment or admiration for the content, without delving into deeper discussion.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1-2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Short avg word count (5-8)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (100%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h) for quick reactions\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with visually appealing or entertaining content (e.g., travel, fashion, funny reels)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Ti ho vista da effeci 😍 🍰\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Bellissimaaaaaa🔥🔥🔥\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Lo sto guardando in loop da 5minuti 😂🤣\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027INFORMATION_SEEKER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This user primarily engages by asking direct questions to gain more information about the content or related topics, indicating a practical interest beyond mere appreciation.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High question rate (50% or more)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low total comments (1-2)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \"Comments often seek practical details or access to content (e.g., \u0027where can I find...\u0027)\",\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with posts that might have follow-up content or events (e.g., podcasts, events)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Si possono trovare le puntate registrate?\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Mi dispiace un sacco essermele perse!\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027TAGGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user\u0027s primary interaction is to tag other users, indicating a desire to share the content with friends or involve them in the conversation, often with minimal additional text.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low avg word count (1)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low emoji rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Comment consists solely or primarily of a user tag\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with content that is easily shareable or relatable to others\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@annymaurizio\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027APPRECIATIVE_FAN\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This persona expresses immediate, enthusiastic admiration for the influencer\u0027s creative work, often using short, positive exclamations and emojis.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Bellissimo!!!❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027SUPPORTIVE_FOLLOWER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona shows affection and support for the influencer, especially on personal posts, often through simple, heartfelt emojis.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 1\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Emoji rate: 100%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Engages with personal content (e.g., birthdays)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027❤️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027PRODUCT_INQUIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona seeks specific product or style information from the influencer, often asking direct questions, sometimes on posts not directly related to the item in question.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003e100h\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Question rate: \u003e0%\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Avg word count: \u003e5\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Cami mi dai info sui tuoi orecchini per favore ⁉️♥️\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027CASUAL_ENGAGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona offers general positive feedback or lighthearted reactions, often with a mix of text and emojis, without deep engagement or specific questions.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg word count: 2-7\u0027, \u0027Emoji rate: 0-100%\u0027, \u0027Reply ratio: 0%\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027😂😂😂😂mortaaaa geniaaa\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Cara mia,frangia o non frangia, spacchi ugualmente.complimenti.\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENTHUSIAST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona is highly engaged, frequently comments early, and expresses strong positive sentiment, often using multiple emojis and sometimes asking questions or tagging friends.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027High total comments (9)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High unique posts commented (9)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very long activity span (2844 days)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Low average hours to comment (2.4h)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027High early commenter rate (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate reply ratio (22%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate emoji rate (56%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate question rate (22%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Sei un genio 😂😂😍😍\u0027, \u0027😍😍😍😍\u0027, \u0027🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE HUMOR SHARER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona engages with humorous or relatable content, often tagging friends to share the joke or express simple, emoji-driven reactions.\u0027,\n",
