                                                                          "   \u0027Zero reply ratio (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Moderate emoji rate (50%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero question rate (0%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Very low average word count (2)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@esteruzz93 Masterchef Parte 2\u0027, \u0027👏🔥🔥🔥\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE PRODUCT INQUIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona comments specifically to ask practical questions about products or services featured in posts, often with an enthusiastic tone.\u0027,\n",
