                                                                          "   \u0027High question rate (100%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027In che supermercati si possono trovare? 🤩\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE CASUAL ADMIRER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona leaves short, direct expressions of affection or appreciation, typically on posts that evoke strong positive feelings.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Very low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
