                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027Vi amo.\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE REACTIVE TAGGER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona primarily engages by tagging friends in comments, often with a strong, sometimes delayed, emotional reaction to the content.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (3)\u0027,\n",
