                                                                          "   \u0027High emoji rate (67%)\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027Zero question rate (0%)\u0027],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027@gabry_gb10 ma ti stavo per taggare io!!!! 🥺🥺😓\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "   \u0027@gabry_adp10 si l avevo già vista, morta hahahahahaha\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027THE ENTHUSIAST\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona consistently engages early with a wide range of content, expressing strong positive emotions through short, emoji-rich comments, often with specific references.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Avg hrs to comment: \u003c0.5h\u0027,\n",
