                                                                          "   \"Comments directly address influencer\u0027s prompt\"],\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027examples\u0027: [\u0027La 3!\u0027]},\n",
                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027FRIEND_CONNECTOR\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \"This user tags friends in comments to draw parallels between the influencer\u0027s content and their shared experiences or inside jokes.\",\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Early commenter (\u003c1h): high\u0027,\n",
