                                                                          " {\u0027codename\u0027: \u0027ENTHUSIASTIC_SUPPORTER\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027description\u0027: \u0027This persona expresses immediate and strong positive sentiment, often in response to relatable or engaging content, and may interact with other commenters.\u0027,\n",
                                                                          "  \u0027signals\u0027: [\u0027Low total comments (1)\u0027,\n",
